  "description": "Intercepts outbound HttpClient calls and answers them from mock rules defined in Echo, so a team is not blocked waiting for a downstream service that does not exist yet. Refuses to arm outside Development and reports contract generation failures as mock responses.",
  "iconFile": "icon.png",
